# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"A quantum-classical workflow runs as one managed workflow job. Its classical stages run on your compute profile, and the primitive jobs that it sends to an IBM Quantum&reg; QPU run on your instance and count against your usage. From that one job, you can report each stage, find the QPU jobs, and cancel them. To start a job and check its status and logs, see [Run a managed workflow](/guides/run-managed-workflow).\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Aliran kerja kuantum-klasik berjalan sebagai satu job aliran kerja terurus. Peringkat klasiknya berjalan pada profil pengkomputeran anda, dan job primitif yang dihantarnya ke QPU IBM Quantum&reg; berjalan pada instance anda dan dikira dalam penggunaan anda. Daripada satu job itu, anda boleh melaporkan setiap peringkat, mencari job QPU dan membatalkannya. Untuk memulakan job dan menyemak status serta lognya, lihat [Jalankan aliran kerja terurus](/guides/run-managed-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin, [deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow).\n"
msgstr "Sebelum anda bermula, [gunakan aliran kerja terurus pertama anda](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Runtime service {#create-the-runtime-service}"
msgstr "Cipta perkhidmatan Runtime {#create-the-runtime-service}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Runtime service in your workflow code with `get_runtime_service()`, and use it in the same way that you use `QiskitRuntimeService` locally. The following workflow runs a Bell circuit with the Sampler primitive, reports each stage with `update_status()`, and returns the counts:\n"
msgstr "Cipta perkhidmatan Runtime dalam kod aliran kerja anda dengan `get_runtime_service()`, dan gunakannya dengan cara yang sama seperti anda menggunakan `QiskitRuntimeService` secara setempat. Aliran kerja berikut menjalankan litar Bell dengan primitif Sampler, melaporkan setiap peringkat dengan `update_status()`, dan mengembalikan kiraan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_runtime_service()` returns a `QiskitRuntimeService` that is set up for your managed workflow job, and it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "`get_runtime_service()` mengembalikan `QiskitRuntimeService` yang disediakan untuk job aliran kerja terurus anda, dan ia menyediakan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Credentials.** The Runtime service uses the API key, instance, and channel that you used to call `run()`, so the workflow code needs no credentials.\n"
msgstr "**Bukti kelayakan.** Perkhidmatan Runtime menggunakan kunci API, instance dan saluran yang anda gunakan untuk memanggil `run()`, jadi kod aliran kerja tidak memerlukan bukti kelayakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tracking.** A workflow records every primitive job that runs through this Runtime service under the managed workflow job, including Sampler, Estimator, and Executor jobs, and jobs in a session or batch. You can list them with `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"
msgstr "**Penjejakan.** Aliran kerja merekodkan setiap job primitif yang berjalan melalui perkhidmatan Runtime ini di bawah job aliran kerja terurus, termasuk job Sampler, Estimator dan Executor, serta job dalam session atau batch. Anda boleh menyenaraikannya dengan `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cancellation.** When you call `job.cancel()`, the managed workflow also cancels the workflow's sessions, batches, and primitive jobs that are still running.\n"
msgstr "**Pembatalan.** Apabila anda memanggil `job.cancel()`, aliran kerja terurus turut membatalkan session, batch dan job primitif aliran kerja yang masih berjalan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow does not track or cancel the jobs of a service that you create with `QiskitRuntimeService()`, although the jobs still run. If the workflow must use another service, cancel its jobs in a [`SIGTERM` handler](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#clean-up-when-a-job-is-canceled).\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus tidak menjejak atau membatalkan job bagi perkhidmatan yang anda cipta dengan `QiskitRuntimeService()`, walaupun job itu tetap berjalan. Jika aliran kerja mesti menggunakan perkhidmatan lain, batalkan jobnya dalam [pengendali `SIGTERM`](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#clean-up-when-a-job-is-canceled).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run primitives in a session or batch {#run-primitives-in-a-session-or-batch}"
msgstr "Jalankan primitif dalam session atau batch {#run-primitives-in-a-session-or-batch}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow also tracks primitive jobs that run in a session or batch. Create the session or batch from a backend that the Runtime service returned, and create the primitives inside the `with` block. `Session` works in the same way:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus turut menjejak job primitif yang berjalan dalam session atau batch. Cipta session atau batch daripada backend yang dikembalikan oleh perkhidmatan Runtime, dan cipta primitif di dalam blok `with`. `Session` berfungsi dengan cara yang sama:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report progress with update_status() {#report-progress-with-update-status}"
msgstr "Laporkan kemajuan dengan update_status() {#report-progress-with-update-status}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow in [Create the Runtime service](#create-the-runtime-service) calls `update_status()` at the start of each stage, so that the job status shows where the workflow is, such as `RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`. Pass one of the following `Job` constants:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja dalam [Cipta perkhidmatan Runtime](#create-the-runtime-service) memanggil `update_status()` pada permulaan setiap peringkat, supaya status job menunjukkan kedudukan aliran kerja, seperti `RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`. Hantar salah satu pemalar `Job` berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Call in the workflow | Job status |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.MAPPING)` | `RUNNING: MAPPING` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.OPTIMIZING_HARDWARE)` | `RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.WAITING_QPU)` | `RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.EXECUTING_QPU)` | `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.POST_PROCESSING)` | `RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Panggilan dalam aliran kerja | Status job |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.MAPPING)` | `RUNNING: MAPPING` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.OPTIMIZING_HARDWARE)` | `RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.WAITING_QPU)` | `RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.EXECUTING_QPU)` | `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` |\n"
"| `update_status(Job.POST_PROCESSING)` | `RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`update_status()` returns `True` if the workflow changed the status. It returns `False` and writes a warning to the logs if the value is not one of these constants, if the job is no longer active, or if the code runs outside a job. It does not raise an error, so a typo does not stop the workflow.\n"
msgstr "`update_status()` mengembalikan `True` jika aliran kerja mengubah status. Ia mengembalikan `False` dan menulis amaran ke log jika nilainya bukan salah satu pemalar ini, jika job tidak lagi aktif, atau jika kod berjalan di luar job. Ia tidak menimbulkan ralat, jadi kesilapan menaip tidak menghentikan aliran kerja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For progress within a stage, such as the iterations of an optimizer, [write log lines](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#best-practice-decide-what-to-log).\n"
msgstr "Untuk kemajuan dalam sesuatu peringkat, seperti lelaran pengoptimum, [tulis baris log](/guides/managed-workflow-logs-and-errors#best-practice-decide-what-to-log).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* REVIEW: each update_status() call writes a SUB_STATUS_CHANGE event, and the 24-hour timeout is measured from the job's latest event (update_fleets_jobs_statuses.py _timed_out). send_error() events count too. This looks like a bug; do not document it until the intended behavior is confirmed. */}\n"
msgstr ""

