"Jika aliran kerja menjalankan primitif dalam session atau batch, senaraikan ID session dan batch dengan `runtime_sessions()`, dan hantar salah satu kepada `runtime_jobs()` untuk mendapatkan hanya job di dalamnya:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `job` object exists only in the notebook that started the run. In a new notebook, get the job again with `client.job(\"<your-job-id>\")`, then call `runtime_jobs()` on it. See [Find a job from a new session](/guides/run-managed-workflow#find-a-job-from-a-new-session).\n"
msgstr "Objek `job` hanya wujud dalam buku nota yang memulakan larian. Dalam buku nota baharu, dapatkan semula job dengan `client.job(\"<your-job-id>\")`, kemudian panggil `runtime_jobs()` padanya. Lihat [Cari job daripada session baharu](/guides/run-managed-workflow#find-a-job-from-a-new-session).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the QPU usage and run times of each QPU job, see [View job metrics](/guides/monitor-job#view-job-metrics). For the usage of your whole instance in the current period, call `client.usage()`. To see how long each stage of the managed workflow job took, see [Check how long each stage took](/guides/run-managed-workflow#check-how-long-each-stage-took).\n"
msgstr "Untuk penggunaan QPU dan masa larian setiap job QPU, lihat [Lihat metrik job](/guides/monitor-job#view-job-metrics). Untuk penggunaan seluruh instance anda dalam tempoh semasa, panggil `client.usage()`. Untuk melihat berapa lama setiap peringkat job aliran kerja terurus mengambil masa, lihat [Semak berapa lama setiap peringkat mengambil masa](/guides/run-managed-workflow#check-how-long-each-stage-took).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel linked QPU jobs {#cancel-linked-qpu-jobs}"
msgstr "Batalkan job QPU yang dipautkan {#cancel-linked-qpu-jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you cancel a managed workflow job with `job.cancel()`, the workflow also tries to cancel the QPU work that the workflow started:\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda membatalkan job aliran kerja terurus dengan `job.cancel()`, aliran kerja turut cuba membatalkan kerja QPU yang dimulakan oleh aliran kerja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Sessions and batches.** The workflow cancels each of the workflow's sessions and batches, which also cancels their queued jobs.\n"
msgstr "**Session dan batch.** Aliran kerja membatalkan setiap session dan batch aliran kerja, yang turut membatalkan job mereka yang beratur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Other primitive jobs.** The workflow cancels each of the workflow's other primitive jobs that are still queued or running.\n"
msgstr "**Job primitif lain.** Aliran kerja membatalkan setiap job primitif lain aliran kerja yang masih beratur atau berjalan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`job.cancel()` returns a message for each QPU job and session, so you can check what was canceled:\n"
msgstr "`job.cancel()` mengembalikan mesej bagi setiap job QPU dan session, supaya anda boleh menyemak apa yang dibatalkan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a workflow that ran in a batch, the message looks like the following:\n"
msgstr "Bagi aliran kerja yang berjalan dalam batch, mesejnya kelihatan seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the client cannot create a `QiskitRuntimeService` from your local credentials, it cancels only the managed workflow job. Cancel the QPU jobs yourself with their IDs from `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"
msgstr "Jika klien tidak dapat mencipta `QiskitRuntimeService` daripada bukti kelayakan setempat anda, ia hanya membatalkan job aliran kerja terurus. Batalkan sendiri job QPU dengan ID mereka daripada `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a workflow stops a job itself, for example because it reached the 24-hour limit, it does not cancel its QPU jobs. Cancel them with their IDs from `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"
msgstr "Apabila aliran kerja menghentikan job sendiri, contohnya kerana ia mencapai had 24 jam, ia tidak membatalkan job QPUnya. Batalkannya dengan ID mereka daripada `job.runtime_jobs()`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* REVIEW: the scheduler's timeout and blocked-account stops (update_fleets_jobs_statuses.py stop_job_if_timeout, FleetsJobCanceller) cancel only the fleet. Only the user stop endpoint (StopJobUseCase) cancels runtime jobs. Confirm whether this is intended before publishing. */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot QPU jobs in a workflow {#troubleshoot-qpu-jobs-in-a-workflow}"
msgstr "Selesaikan masalah job QPU dalam aliran kerja {#troubleshoot-qpu-jobs-in-a-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `get_runtime_service()` raises `KeyError: 'QISKIT_IBM_CHANNEL'`. | The code runs in your local notebook, not in a managed workflow job. Use `QiskitRuntimeService()` locally. |\n"
"| `update_status()` returns `False`, and the logs show `'sub_status' not provided or is not valid`. | The value is not one of the `Job` constants, or the job is no longer active. |\n"
"| `job.runtime_jobs()` returns `[]`. | The workflow created its service with `QiskitRuntimeService()`, or it has not run a primitive yet. |\n"
"| A session's jobs are not tracked. | The session was created from a backend of a different service. Get the backend from `get_runtime_service()`. |\n"
"| The workflow logs show `Could not associate runtime job with serverless job`. | The workflow could not record a primitive job. The primitive job still runs, but it is not tracked. |\n"
"| `job.cancel()` shows `No QiskitRuntimeService can be associated to the given token and instance.` | The client could not create a `QiskitRuntimeService` from your local credentials, so it canceled only the managed workflow job. |\n"
"| `client.job()` fails with `Job [...] not found`. | The job ID is wrong, or the job belongs to another user. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Punca |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `get_runtime_service()` menimbulkan `KeyError: 'QISKIT_IBM_CHANNEL'`. | Kod berjalan dalam buku nota setempat anda, bukan dalam job aliran kerja terurus. Gunakan `QiskitRuntimeService()` secara setempat. |\n"
"| `update_status()` mengembalikan `False`, dan log menunjukkan `'sub_status' not provided or is not valid`. | Nilainya bukan salah satu pemalar `Job`, atau job tidak lagi aktif. |\n"
"| `job.runtime_jobs()` mengembalikan `[]`. | Aliran kerja mencipta perkhidmatannya dengan `QiskitRuntimeService()`, atau ia belum menjalankan primitif lagi. |\n"
"| Job sesuatu session tidak dijejak. | Session dicipta daripada backend perkhidmatan yang berbeza. Dapatkan backend daripada `get_runtime_service()`. |\n"
"| Log aliran kerja menunjukkan `Could not associate runtime job with serverless job`. | Aliran kerja tidak dapat merekodkan job primitif. Job primitif tetap berjalan, tetapi tidak dijejak. |\n"
"| `job.cancel()` menunjukkan `No QiskitRuntimeService can be associated to the given token and instance.` | Klien tidak dapat mencipta `QiskitRuntimeService` daripada bukti kelayakan setempat anda, jadi ia hanya membatalkan job aliran kerja terurus. |\n"
"| `client.job()` gagal dengan `Job [...] not found`. | ID job salah, atau job itu milik pengguna lain. |\n"

